# GitHub as a Drive - Environment Variables Example

# This app doesn't require environment variables for basic usage.
# Authentication is handled via GitHub Personal Access Token entered in the UI.

# Optional: If you want to add NextAuth or OAuth in the future:
# GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=your_github_oauth_app_client_id
# GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=your_github_oauth_app_client_secret
# NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000
# NEXTAUTH_SECRET=your_secret_here
